// Suspicious IIS Module Registration | T1505.004 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_iis_susp_module_registration.yml
process.parent.executable.caseless:*\\w3wp.exe AND (process.command_line:*appcmd.exe\ add\ module* OR (process.command_line:*\ system.enterpriseservices.internal.publish* AND process.executable.caseless:*\\powershell.exe) OR (process.command_line:*gacutil* AND process.command_line:*\ \/I*))
